has no path there","applier.py:750 — links_failed would be an additive PRINTED field only","Plan: 'Deliberately NOT doing' relies on edit 1 for 'durable protection', but that protection is stderr-only for partial failures"],"finding":"Edit 1 is framed as the 'durable protection' that makes 'any residual failure visible', but a PARTIAL link failure (some applied, some failed) neither trips the silent-noop canary (a total-noop applied==0 detector) nor drives a non-zero pass exit — links_failed is only printed to stderr, not wired into the RECONCILER_FAIL_SILENT_NOOP fail-loud promotion. A residual cancelled/failed delete under --yes could still exit the pass green, the same failure-exits-green class this ticket exists to close.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f59ae41453823bdfb","impact":0.33,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach section, edit 1 ('This alone makes the canary able to fire' / 'edit 1 makes any residual failure visible, which is the durable protection')","norm_id":"n381b5f2a95acc0f7","priority":0.22,"reason":"default-advisory","scenarios":["A single update mutation with 2 link removals where 1 delete genuinely fails (non-idempotent stderr) and 1 succeeds: links_applied=1, links_failed=1, canary silent, pass exits 0 with the failure only in a stderr substring"],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.6667,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","